ers into yarn. Its products are used by textile mills for weaving and knitting fabrics. The company caters to both domestic and international markets. The company exports its products to Bangladesh, China, Egypt, Vietnam, and Portugal. It also operates solar power plant. Vivekanand Cotspin Limited was founded in 1999 and is based in Mehsana, India.","employees":143,"earnDates":[],"exDiv":null,"asOf":1795613654},"analyst":null,"cap":"Other","caFix":null,"fetched":1795613654,"source":"Yahoo Finance (public chart, fundamentals-timeseries & quoteSummary endpoints)","news":{"q":"\"VIVEKANAND COTSPIN\" stock when:90d","items":[{"t":"VIVEKANAND COTSPIN Lower Circuit Today: Price, Data and Peers","s":"Univest","d":1794996300,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiggFBVV95cUxPY0E1b1FOUEMxUjFhWHExZUdSTEI4a09tdFlSa0QwOS1QZ0tWdm1sVHlMeFczV2RJSUt4cU04NHB6NldSZWVNS3NBeVBmU2otdE55YjExblpKSU1FYXBXcHpUdFFCY1Fycm9rcmlEelVJbWZ6aHZQSU1vaVFHamN4eW93?oc=5","g":[]},{"t":"Vivekanand Cotspin H1FY27 Results: Net profit turns positive at ₹329 lakh","s":"scanx.trade","d":1793779200,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwwFBVV95cUxOODhMZjhzWWk2cUVzZGtmSFdnbF9BOWxCM2EwTzk3aS04cXIwc2FNblpqdVViSjVzMml6LU40V2JMNmVERGJoWTJJWW9KQXJSLVJCZjBVV3ZnaC1IVVBkN3RBX3czb3JybEdsTk5uTWYyYm1rLXRRLVM3UDFSbWhOb2YySE5wWnhpeE1ibjVDZFk5V1FPX3JpdWlVTHhtMmUtZUd0UXJFUjFOQkJSQjh3Q21JN09HQXZJbGxrdmpaQktGaHc?oc=5","g":[]},{"t":"Vivekanand Cotspin Ltd Shareholding Pattern – Promoters, FIIs & DIIs","s":"Value Research","d":1790657241,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijwFBVV95cUxOZ2hiVVNVRGc1UHVpQWZqTE9IVlNnS0NJdllTZGVTVTZoTlVOUy1IQXFVZkNScHFiMU5GTVllSXBocFRFdFhZVDE5LWliQktXWGJNMTh0T3lwd3ctQW92YUVfaENyeGJBMjBzNGtWUVUtZjh5Q3JvRWNDck1NUkN3aDlOQlVzcHY1dlRXYWlROA?oc=5","g":[]},{"t":"Vivekanand Cotspin Lists at ₹38, Debuts 2.70% Above IPO Price","s":"HDFC Sky","d":1790578800,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihwFBVV95cUxNTGtldkhFWDV2VnVKaWdJT09oVGc3M2F3aU5XU3Z2clUtR1Z4NzhhVlp4X0dNOThYaUNUbUxFRj